{"early_stopping": "Early stopping is a technique used in machine learning to prevent overfitting by stopping the training process when the model's performance on a validation set stops improving. In the context of the given models, early stopping is employed to ensure that the models generalize well to unseen data and do not become too specialized to the training data."},
