{"minimize_loss_and_gradient": "Minimizing loss and gradient refers to the process of adjusting the model's parameters to reduce the difference between the predicted and actual values (loss) and to ensure that the gradient, which indicates the direction and rate of change of the loss function, is as small as possible. This results in a more accurate and stable model."},
