{"intermediary_feature_fusion__identifies__connections_and_correlations_between_image_and_text_domains": "The predicate \"identifies\" in this context refers to the process by which Intermediary Feature Fusion recognizes and establishes links between disparate data types, enhancing the model's ability to understand complex relationships."},
