{"early_fusion": "Early fusion is a method used in multimodal data processing where different data types or modalities are combined at the initial stage of the process.|Here is another description: Early fusion is a method that integrates different modalities at the input level, aiming to combine data from various sources before processing. It is often used in multimodal data analysis to create a unified representation of the data."},
