{"late_fusion": "Late fusion is a method used in multimodal data processing where different data modalities are combined at a later stage in the processing pipeline. It is often compared to early fusion, which integrates modalities at the input level.|Here is another description: Late fusion is a method where different modalities are merged at a higher level of representation after initial processing. It is often used in multimodal data analysis to combine information from various sources."},
