{"timely_assistance": "Timely assistance in this context refers to the prompt and effective help provided to affected areas during a disaster. It underscores the critical need for rapid response in disaster situations, where every moment counts in saving lives and mitigating damage. Multimodal fusion methodologies help achieve this by offering comprehensive and actionable insights to rescue teams."},
