{"medical_diagnosis_autonomous_systems_and_multimedia_content_analysis": "Medical diagnosis, autonomous systems, and multimedia content analysis are specific applications within diverse domains. Medical diagnosis involves using various data sources to improve disease detection and treatment. Autonomous systems refer to robots and surveillance systems that can make better decisions with advanced methods. Multimedia content analysis includes tasks like content-based retrieval and cross-modal information retrieval, aiming to enhance the relevance and accuracy of results."},
