{"medical_diagnostics__utilizes__data_from_many_sources_like_scans_textual_data_and_patient_records": "Utilizes in the context of medical diagnostics means employing or making use of different types of data and information sources. This involves integrating various data points to enhance the accuracy and comprehensiveness of diagnostic processes."},
{"data_from_many_sources_like_scans_textual_data_and_patient_records": "Data from many sources like scans, textual data, and patient records encompasses a wide range of information used in medical diagnostics. This includes imaging scans such as X-rays and MRIs, textual data from clinical notes and reports, and patient records that contain historical health information and current symptoms."},
