{"improve_decision_making_in_autonomous_systems_such_as_robots_and_surveillance": "Improving decision-making in autonomous systems such as robots and surveillance involves enhancing the ability of these systems to make informed and effective decisions based on the data they collect and analyze. This can lead to more efficient and accurate operations, better resource allocation, and improved overall performance in tasks such as navigation, object recognition, and threat detection."},
