{"improve_the_relevance_and_accuracy_of_results_for_tasks_such_as_content_based_retrieval_and_cross_modal_information_retrieval": "Improving the relevance and accuracy of results for tasks such as content-based retrieval and cross-modal information retrieval involves enhancing the effectiveness of systems that search for and retrieve multimedia content based on its content or across different modalities (e.g., text, images, audio). This improvement leads to more precise and pertinent results, thereby increasing the utility and reliability of such systems."},
