{"transformer_based_architectures": "Transformer-based architectures, such as RoBERTa and Vision Transformer, are advanced deep learning models that utilize self-attention mechanisms to process input data. They are designed to handle various types of data, including text and images, and are often used in natural language processing and computer vision tasks."},
