{"to_mitigate_problems_associated_with_incremental_learning": "The problems associated with incremental learning refer to challenges that arise when a model is trained incrementally, such as overfitting, catastrophic forgetting, and difficulties in retaining previously learned information while acquiring new knowledge. These issues can significantly impact the performance and reliability of deep learning models in dynamic environments."},
