{"image_text_relations": "Image-text relations refer to the connections and interactions between visual elements (images) and textual elements in conveying information. Evaluating these relations involves analyzing how images and text complement each other to enhance understanding and communication.|Here is another description: Image-text relations refer to the connections and interactions between visual elements and textual information within a dataset or model. These relations are crucial for understanding how images and text complement each other in conveying information."},
