{"this_study": "This study refers to the proposed research that introduces a multimodal middle fusion paradigm for analyzing multimedia content from social media during disasters. It aims to enhance the detection and understanding of catastrophic events by integrating both textual and image analysis.|Here is another description: This study refers to the proposed research that introduces a multimodal middle fusion paradigm incorporating Cross-modal attention and Self-attention to enhance learning from both image and text modalities for real-time global event detection."},
