{"all_three_tasks_in_the_crisismmd_dataset_by_combining_textual_and_image_analysis": "All three tasks in the CrisisMMD dataset by combining textual and image analysis refer to the specific objectives within the CrisisMMD dataset that the study aims to address. These tasks likely involve the analysis of casualties, infrastructure damage, and information about missing individuals, utilizing both text and image data to achieve more accurate and comprehensive results."},
