{"the_proposed_method": "The proposed method refers to a multimodal middle fusion paradigm that incorporates Cross-modal attention and Self-attention mechanisms to enhance learning from both image and text modalities. This approach is designed to improve the accuracy of real-time global event detection, particularly in catastrophic scenarios, by leveraging the complementary information available in both textual and visual data sources."},
