{"social_media_networks": "Social media networks are online platforms that allow users to create and share content or participate in social networking. They have become a ubiquitous part of modern communication, enabling people to connect and share information globally.|Here is another description: Social media networks are platforms where users share content such as photos, videos, and text. They have become a significant source of real-time information, especially during events and emergencies."},
