{"large_scale_image_recognition_and_textual_understanding": "Large-scale image recognition and textual understanding refer to advanced technologies that process and analyze vast amounts of visual and textual data. These technologies are designed to interpret and understand the content of images and text on a massive scale, enabling more accurate and efficient data classification."},
