{"natural_disasters__include__the_iraq_iran_earthquakes": "The term \"include\" signifies that the subject encompasses or contains the object as part of its broader category or list. In this context, it indicates that the Iraq-Iran earthquakes are one of the several natural disasters considered in the dataset."},
