{"informative_and_non_informative": "The categories 'Informative and Non-informative' under Informativeness describe the two primary types of information that can be communicated during a disaster. Informative information is relevant, useful, and helps in decision-making, whereas non-informative information lacks these qualities and may not contribute to effective disaster response."},
