{"little_or_no_damage": "\"Little or no damage\" is one of the levels within the Damage Severity Assessment, indicating that the infrastructure and utilities have either sustained minimal damage or have remained unaffected in the given context."},
{"damage_severity_assessment__includes__mild_damage": "The predicate \"includes\" signifies that the Damage Severity Assessment category encompasses different levels of damage. It acts as a connector, indicating that the assessment covers a range of damage levels."},
