{"effectively_finding_and_selecting_features_required_for_disaster_classification": "Effectively finding and selecting features required for disaster classification involves the precise identification and extraction of relevant visual information from images that are indicative of disaster events. This process is vital for accurately categorizing and understanding the nature and extent of disasters through visual data."},
