{"resnet_50__was_pretrained_on__large_scale_image_datasets_like_imagenet": "The phrase \"was pretrained on\" indicates that ResNet-50 underwent an initial training phase on a specific dataset to learn general visual representations before being fine-tuned for a more specific task. This pretraining helps the model develop a foundational understanding of visual data, which can then be adapted to specialized applications."},
{"large_scale_image_datasets_like_imagenet": "Large-scale image datasets like ImageNet are extensive collections of labeled images used for training machine learning models. These datasets contain millions of images across thousands of categories, providing a rich source of visual information that helps models like ResNet-50 learn diverse and robust visual features."},
