{"generic_visual_representations": "Generic visual representations refer to the broad and versatile set of features that ResNet-50 learns from large-scale image datasets like ImageNet. These representations include low-level details such as edges and high-level concepts like objects and scenes, making the model adaptable to various image classification and detection tasks."},
