{"vision_transformer": "Vision Transformer is a novel approach that leverages the transformer architecture, originally designed for natural language processing tasks, to process image data as sequences of tokens. It utilizes self-attention mechanisms to capture global dependencies between different parts of the image, allowing it to consider long-range interactions and contextual relationships."},
{"vision_transformer__performs_much_better_than__resnet_and_densenet_at_extracting_relevant_information_from_the_images_for_disaster_assessment": "The phrase \"performs much better than\" indicates a comparative performance evaluation where Vision Transformer shows superior effectiveness and efficiency in a specific task compared to other models. This superiority is measured in terms of accuracy, precision, recall, and F1 score on test data."},
