{"text_only_classifier": "The text-only classifier is a machine learning model designed to analyze and classify textual data without relying on visual inputs. It is evaluated using various metrics to assess its performance in different tasks."},
{"text_only_classifier__performs_better_on__informativeness_and_humanitarian_tasks": "The phrase \"performs better on\" indicates that the text-only classifier shows superior results or higher effectiveness when applied to specific types of tasks compared to other models or approaches."},
