{"self_attention_mechanisms__were_employed__to_mitigate_problems_associated_with_incremental_learning": "The employment of self-attention mechanisms in this context refers to their integration into the model architecture to specifically tackle and reduce the challenges and issues arising from incremental learning processes."},
