{"implementing_additional_preprocessing_techniques": "Implementing additional preprocessing techniques involves the use of various methods to enhance the quality and balance of the dataset. These techniques may include data augmentation, resampling methods like SMOTE, assigning class weights, generating balanced batches, and creating synthetic data using Generative Adversarial Networks (GANs). These methods aim to mitigate issues such as class imbalance, data noise, and insufficient ground truth labels."},
