{"a_great_degree_of_bias": "A great degree of bias refers to the significant presence of systematic errors or prejudices in the data or analysis. In the context of research using data from online social networks, this bias can arise from various sources such as data representation issues, noise in the data, lack of ground truth labels, and the prevalence of misinformation."},
