{"misinformation_in_news_related_data_on_social_media": "Misinformation in news-related data on social media refers to the spread of false or misleading information through social media platforms, particularly in the context of news and current events. This phenomenon is a significant concern as it can lead to the dissemination of inaccurate facts and the manipulation of public opinion."},
