{"ai_assisted_labeling": "AI-assisted labeling refers to the use of artificial intelligence technologies to aid in the process of assigning labels to data. This method is particularly useful in scenarios where manual labeling is either too time-consuming or prone to human error.|Here is another description: AI-assisted labeling involves the use of artificial intelligence technologies to automate or enhance the process of assigning labels or annotations to data. This method aims to increase the accuracy, consistency, and efficiency of the labeling process, particularly in scenarios where human annotators may introduce inconsistencies."},
