{"weakly_supervised_and_semi_supervised_learning_strategies__can_reduce__the_dependence_on_manually_labeled_datasets": "The phrase \"can reduce\" indicates a potential outcome or benefit that can be achieved through the application of weakly supervised and semi-supervised learning strategies. In this context, it suggests that these methods have the capability to lessen or mitigate a specific dependency or requirement."},
