{"with_regard_to_jurisdictional_claims_in_published_maps_and_institutional_affiliations": "The object \"with regard to jurisdictional claims in published maps and institutional affiliations\" refers to the specific area where Springer Nature maintains neutrality, ensuring that their publications do not imply any stance on territorial or institutional disputes."},
