{"terms__apply_in_addition_to__any_applicable_website_terms_and_conditions_a_relevant_site_licence_or_a_personal_subscription": "The phrase \"apply in addition to\" indicates that the terms of use are supplementary to other existing agreements or conditions. This means that users must comply with these terms alongside any other relevant terms, such as website terms and conditions, site licenses, or personal subscriptions."},
